      "locator": "UNLABELED EQUATION CH1 LINE 107",
      "source_text": "\\begin{equation}\n  \\psi_n(\\partial I^n) = e_0,\\quad\n  \\psi_n \\text{ は, } I^n - \\partial I^n \\text{ を }\n  S^n - e_0 \\text{ の上に同相に写す.}\n\\end{equation}",
